Thank you @Spomky, this is worth having and today gave it a lot of evidence. Six PRs closed on exactly this ground in one sweep, and #64749 is the uncomfortable one: `Message::toStringForArchive()` and `toIterableForArchive()`, four lines of existing API away, approved before the question was asked.

